<title>USA: Sauk Rapids, Minn., won by FBS Investment.</title>
<headline>Sauk Rapids, Minn., won by FBS Investment.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>FBS Investment Services, Inc. said it won $1.080 million of Sauk Rapids, Minn., general obligation taxable tax increment bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 7.0842 percent.</p>
</text>
